pass_a = ("Miss Fon's class decided to make a school garden. Every Friday the pupils dug the soil, planted beans and tomatoes, and watered them. "
          "At first, nothing grew and some pupils wanted to stop. Miss Fon said, 'A garden needs patience.' "
          "After three weeks, tiny green leaves came up. The pupils jumped for joy. At the end of the term, they sold the vegetables to parents and used the money to buy new books for the class library.")
assert len(pass_a) < 650
fig = boxes(["Characters: who is in the story?", "Setting: where and when?", "Problem: what goes wrong?", "Ending: how does it finish?"], size=14)
