summ = "Mama Ngo sells vegetables in the Mokolo market in Yaoundé. She wakes up at four o'clock and goes to the farm to buy tomatoes and cabbages. She arrives at the market at six. She sells until two in the afternoon. Then she goes home, cooks for her family and helps her children with their homework."
assert len(summ) < 650
fig = boxes(["Read the whole text", "Underline the key points", "Write them in your own words", "Count the words: keep it short"], size=14)
